      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEWIE KELLY (1) was in the money at this track two runs ago before making up some late ground but never threatening at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track. Has been coming from wide barriers so is much better served by the inside draw. Should get every chance from there. COWBOY CULTURE (9) comes here following a Group One sixth nine days ago over 1609m at this track, beaten 14 metres by Loucasso. Had been racing consistently prior. That form should measure up here. THE WICKED WARRIOR (7) should be at his peak for this. Finished fourth at Wagga at the latest appearance a week-and-a-half ago. Could give the top fancies plenty to think about. BELIEVE IN DREAMS (5) is worth including off a last-start win by 8 metres at Wagga when leading for most of the trip as the $1.60 favourite.",
